      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.26,
      "end_seconds": 28.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Okay, of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.92,
      "end_seconds": 43.4,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a tight band around my head. I've been putting this off for weeks. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
