      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.86,
      "end_seconds": 325.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.78,
      "end_seconds": 332.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "that's all I needed to to check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.21,
      "end_seconds": 371.43,
      "duration_seconds": 23.22,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be tension-type headache, or it might be eye strain. Take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches. Let's plan a check in four weeks. How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
